{"_id":"68a7361b8ec3d8323af1734b","nodeId":"5zyYpu9cyuTFwQCjTbHpS","roadmapSlug":"full-stack","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:06.907Z","description":"# Route53\n\nRoute53 is AWS's Domain Name System (DNS) service that plays a critical role in connecting user requests to your web application or other resources within your infrastructure. With Route53, you can easily manage domains, redirect traffic, and configure domain-related settings. It has several advantages, including high availability, low latency, and integration with other AWS resources.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Route53","url":"https://aws.amazon.com/route53/","_id":"6a7f4a8ccb44947debcf7c5b"},{"type":"video","title":"Amazon Route 53","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGWgfhZByAI","_id":"6a7f4a8ccb44947debcf7c5c"},{"type":"video","title":"AWS Route 53 Domain Name","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jDz4j_kkyLA","_id":"6a7f4a8ccb44947debcf7c5d"},{"type":"video","title":"DNS with AWS Route 53","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yRIY7BJohfo&t=2s","_id":"6a7f4a8ccb44947debcf7c5e"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:04:12.015Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d041637f","title":"Scrimba - Fullstack Developer Path","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://scrimba.com/c0fullstack?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/full-stack/content/5zyYpu9cyuTFwQCjTbHpS.md"}
